      "CoupletIndex": 11,
      "SectionIndex1": 0
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 25,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "این جهان را به نظم شاخ زند",
      "CoupletIndex": 12,
      "SectionIndex1": 0
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 26,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "هر چه در باغ طبع من کارد",
      "CoupletIndex": 12,
      "SectionIndex1": 0
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 27,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "از فلک تنگدل مشو مسعود",
      "CoupletIndex": 13,
      "SectionIndex1": 0
    },
    {
